{{Passive skill box|Vile Bastion}}

'''Vile Bastion''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Occultist]]. It grants flat [[energy shield]] regeneration and increased maximum energy shield based on your capped [[spell block]] chance. It also grants immunity to [[stun]] while you have any amount of energy shield. Hits that fully deplete energy shield will not stun the player.<ref>https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3284453</ref>

